    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.096,
                0.167,
                0.901,
                0.209
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "It also delineates the process for suppliers to use in reporting on their compliance, as well as the range of potential BCG responses to suppliers' failure to meet SCOC requirements.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.095,
                0.233,
                0.903,
                0.34
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Our due diligence for the period of 1 January 2025 to 31 December 2025 has not revealed any actual adverse impacts or significant risks requiring concrete measures further to our general measures implemented. However, the work on human rights and due diligence is a continuous effort, and we therefore continue to develop and evaluate our measures and assessment criteria to capture any risk of human rights violation in our operations or among our vendors.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.097,
                0.365,
                0.418,
                0.383
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Due diligence and our commitment"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.096,
                0.386,
                0.903,
                0.493
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "BCG expects its Suppliers to share its commitment to human rights, inclusion and the principle of non-discrimination in the workplace. Suppliers shall conduct their employment practices in full compliance with all applicable laws and regulations. As any violation to human rights is unacceptable to any BCG partner, we continuously monitor our vendors and validate, their provided services, on any risk measure.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.097,
                0.519,
                0.427,
                0.535
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Grievance Communication Channels"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.096,
                0.541,
                0.896,
                0.647
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Grievances can be reported through BCG's existing grievance mechanisms set out in our current Whistleblower Policy, which is available through the BCG Speak Up Line, found on the Company's Internal Navigator page, as well as on the Company's external website\\(^{4}\\). Internal BCG complaints may also be reported directly to any member of the Ombuds team as set out in the above-mentioned Whistleblower Policy.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.097,
                0.717,
                0.606,
                0.736
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "This document is an English translation of the signed original.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
